Notes
-----
* AMReX modifications. The two local patches to AMReX (a per-instance input
  namespace and a per-instance physical geometry, both confined to the mesh
  layer) are redistributed under AMReX's BSD-3-Clause; AMReX's LICENSE and NOTICE
  are retained in shared/amrex/.

* Release numbers. CRESCENT version 1.0 is released by Lawrence Livermore
  National Laboratory under LLNL release number LLNL-CODE-2024694 and WINDSCAPE
  version 1.0 under LLNL release number LLNL-CODE-2024697; later versions
  inherit these licenses.
